      `the fact is an aggravating fact or a previous conviction by the offender` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 724(3)(e) the prosecutor must establish the fact by proof beyond a reasonable doubt` MEANS
    BRANCH
