      `each charge has been described in open court` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the offender has agreed with the facts asserted in the description of each charge` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the offender has acknowledged having committed the offence described in each charge` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 725(1)(b.1) the court must consider the outstanding charges` MEANS
